'''Deep Sea''' is an underwater route that is accessible from [[Brine Road (West of the Old Shipwreck)]].

The underwater maze leads to Togepi Island and the [[Sapphire Cave]].

==Items==
{{ItemTable/Header}}
{{ItemTable/Data|DEEPSEASCALE||Deep Sea Scale|Hidden by a boulder in the northeast corner.|DeepSeaScale2_DeepSea.png}}
{{ItemTable/Data|DEEPSEASCALE||Deep Sea Scale|Several pink scales found underwater. Daily respawn.|DeepSeaScale_DeepSea.png}}
{{ItemTable/Data|HEARTSCALE||Heart Scale|Hidden by a boulder surrounded by seaweed.|HeartScale2_DeepSea.png}}
{{ItemTable/Data|HEARTSCALE||Heart Scale|Hidden by a boulder on the western side.|HeartScale_DeepSea.png}}
{{ItemTable/Data|HEARTSCALE||Heart Scale|Hidden by a boulder near the Togepi Island surfacing point.|HeartScale3_DeepSea.png}}
{{ItemTable/Data|SHINYSTONE||Shiny Stone|On the East side of the Togepi Island.|ShinyStone_DeepSea.png}}
{{ItemTable/Data|SAPPHIRE||Sapphire|In an isolated corner deep within the maze.|Sapphire_DeepSea.png}}
{{ItemTable/Footer}}

